{"The Armageddon is out of the dock, Commander. Six Warden hearts in its spine and one very large cannon. Point it at something.":"awe","Armageddon commissioned. When it fires the Worldbreaker, I'd suggest everyone look away.":"playful","The Sovereign Ark has launched. I can feel every ship it commands, Commander. They fight as one now.":"awe","Sovereign Ark commissioned. The fleet has a crown again.":"excited","The Eclipse Harbinger is awake. Its reactor beats in time with the Void, Commander. Use it before it starts using us.":"grave","Eclipse Harbinger commissioned. Its drones are already restless.":"grave","We have enough Titan Cores for an Armageddon, Commander. The shipyard is waiting.":"warm","We have the Titan Cores for a Sovereign Ark. Imagine the whole fleet moving as one.":"warm","There are enough Titan Cores for the Eclipse Harbinger. I don't like it, Commander, but I understand why we'd build it.":"grave","The Armageddon is with us. Clear a line for the Worldbreaker.":"fierce","Armageddon on the line. Charge the cannon, Commander.":"fierce","The Sovereign Ark takes command. Every ship, link up and hold formation.":"fierce","Sovereign Ark on the field. Shields up, fighters out.":"fierce","The Harbinger is here. Release the swarm, Commander.":"fierce","Eclipse Harbinger on the field. Let the drones hunt.":"fierce","Commander, they've brought an Armageddon. Break it with bombers and the Harbinger before its cannon charges.":"urgent","Their Sovereign Ark is linking their fleet. Hit its hangars hard, Commander.":"urgent","An enemy Harbinger. Spread the fleet before its swarm finds us.":"urgent","Worldbreaker Cannon, firing!":"excited","There it goes. Worldbreaker away!":"excited","Fleet Command Uplink! Strike wing, launch!":"excited","The Ark is calling its wing. Fighters away!":"excited","Neural Swarm released. Six targets, one mind.":"excited","The swarm is loose, Commander!":"excited"}